; @back 21_1 subId:Front pos:50,50 rotation:,,0 scale:1
; @mask MainBackground-Front
; @wait 0.4

[PrintTextModified Text:哇，里面有好多危险的东西！|#0201Adv15_Noah002| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:把那个那个还有那个堆叠起来做成装置艺术，<br>应该会很好玩～|#0201Adv15_Noah003| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

