@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Pensive1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Smile1

; ＠備考◆少し呆れ気味

[PrintTextModified Text:……是吗？|#0201Adv15_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚试图打开门，<br>但门被一把挂锁锁住了，打不开。|#0201Adv15_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:气气——进不去啊？<br>这样就没法画画了。|#0201Adv15_Noah004| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看来是这样。那我们去别的地方吧——|#0201Adv15_Hiro003| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我刚转身，<br>就看到一个少女从过道那头走了过来。|#0201Adv15_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Surprised1,Option-ArmL-Off

; ＠備考◆ハッとする

[PrintTextModified Text:………！|#0201Adv15_Alisa001| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是紫藤亚里沙。|#0201Adv15_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她也注意到了我们，<br>尴尬地站在原地。|#0201Adv15_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:40 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed SubId:Middle
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙，你应该已经被放出来了吧。<br>来这里是有什么事？|#0201Adv15_Hiro004| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off

[PrintTextModified Text:没必要告诉你。|#0201Adv15_Alisa002| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是吗。那就不多问了。<br>诺亚，我们走。|#0201Adv15_Hiro005| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙手里拿的那张纸，是什么？|#0201Adv15_Noah005| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我正准备带着诺亚从亚里沙身边经过，<br>但诺亚似乎对亚里沙手中的纸很感兴趣。|#0201Adv15_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我也注意到了，顿时吃了一惊。|#0201Adv15_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:40 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Surprised1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:（……报纸……？）|#0201Adv15_Hiro006| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看到这个与监牢格格不入的东西，<br>我不能坐视不理，向亚里沙走近一步。|#0201Adv15_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed SubId:Middle
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Normal1,Option-ArmL-Off

[PrintTextModified Text:你这是在哪里得到的？|#0201Adv15_Hiro007| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Pensive1,Option-ArmL-Off

[PrintTextModified Text:……惩罚室里。<br>被绑在十字刑架上的时候，<br>偶然在架子缝隙里发现的。|#0201Adv15_Alisa003| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙不情愿地回答道。|#0201Adv15_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Normal1,Option-ArmL-Off

[PrintTextModified Text:不知道是用了什么方法，<br>但好像是之前像我们这样被抓来的家伙搞到的。|#0201Adv15_Alisa004| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在这个监牢里，<br>外界的信息被彻底屏蔽了。<br>这样看来，很可能是以前的某个囚犯用了什么魔法。|#0201Adv15_Hiro008| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我已经看过好几遍了，给你吧。|#0201Adv15_Alisa005| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙把报纸递给了我。|#0201Adv15_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; 【魔女図鑑】『新聞紙』入手
; ========================================
; @spawn Clue params:
; @despawn Clue

@UpdateWitchBook Id:14 Category:Note Version:1

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:五年前的报道啊。真有意思……|#0201Adv15_Hiro009| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是啊……我想着也许还有其他线索，<br>所以来找找看。|#0201Adv15_Alisa006| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就算有什么，<br>所有惩罚室都上了锁，<br>不进去的话恐怕找不到吧。|#0201Adv15_Hiro010| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off

[PrintTextModified Text:啧，这样哦……|#0201Adv15_Alisa007| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我突然注意到，<br>亚里沙给我的报纸边缘有微微的烧焦痕迹。|#0201Adv15_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:有被烧过的痕迹啊。|#0201Adv15_Hiro011| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Pensive1,Option-ArmL-Off

[PrintTextModified Text:那是我干的。<br>报纸上有用血写的字，看着瘆得慌。|#0201Adv15_Alisa008| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不过后来我想可能是重要信息，<br>就没继续烧了。|#0201Adv15_Alisa009| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Normal1,Option-ArmL-Off

[PrintTextModified Text:我的魔法是【点火】。|#0201Adv15_Alisa010| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 炎をぼっと点す音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_30 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Normal1,ArmL11,Angle01/Option_ArmL>Option_ArmL11

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙在手指尖上<br>轻轻燃起一小团火焰，<br>就好像拿着一支看不见的打火机似的。|#0201Adv15_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:哇～，好漂亮！！|#0201Adv15_Noah006| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Surprised1,Option-ArmL-Off

[PrintTextModified Text:漂、漂亮个屁啊！|#0201Adv15_Alisa011| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:欸——超级漂亮啊？<br>亚里沙真厉害。|#0201Adv15_Noah007| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Flushed1,ArmL2,Option-ArmL-Off

[PrintTextModified Text:你这家伙真让人摸不着头脑……|#0201Adv15_Alisa012| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（能够产生火焰的魔法吗……如果魔女化程度加深，<br>　这种能力可能会变得很危险）|#0201Adv15_Hiro012|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@UpdateWitchBook Id:Alisa Category:Profile Version:6

[PrintTextModified Text:我们该走了。|#0201Adv15_Hiro013| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:随你们便。<br>我还想再调查一下这附近。|#0201Adv15_Alisa013| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙似乎被惩罚室吸引住了，<br>她摇摇晃晃地向深处走去。|#0201Adv15_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我们离开了那里。|#0201Adv15_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

